--
-- 1414: Blog post -- "Five Ways to Trigger an AI Agent: A UOB IT Operations Case Study"
--
-- Hand-authored case study of the THIRD corporate run of WSQ Agentic AI Applications
-- with Claude Code (TGS-2025052468), delivered 2026-09-16 to 22 IT operations staff
-- from UOB by trainer Dr Alfred Ang. Siblings:
--   * 'uob-agentic-ai-claude-code-it-support-ticketing-app'          (24 IT support / ticketing app)
--   * 'uob-pmo-kanban-board-claude-code-corporate-training'          (20 infra+dev / PMO Kanban board)
-- This third post deliberately differs in ANGLE rather than repeating the build-log
-- shape: the teaching frame is the agentic loop plus the five EXTENSION POINTS sorted
-- by what TRIGGERS them (CLAUDE.md = always, tools/skills = on demand, hooks = event,
-- commands = manual, subagents = delegation), which is what the cohort was taught.
--
-- CLASS PHOTO: R2 key blog/uob-agentic-ai-claude-code-20260916.jpg -- compressed from
-- the 1600x900 original to 1100px / q62 (140KB, under the 150KB target, never upscaled)
-- per the standing pre-upload compression rule. Verified HTTP 200 before this insert.
--
-- COURSE FACTS (full fee $500, 50%/70% funding tiers, timings, TGS code) match the live
-- product page and the sibling posts -- read, not recalled.
--
-- SHARE SENTINELS: `linkedin_urn` and `facebook_post_id` ship as 'manual-skip'. The post
-- is back-dated to the class date (2026-09-16), and publishDue treats a non-empty share
-- marker as "already shared", so the pipeline will not push a back-dated post to the
-- live social feeds.
--
-- `content` is pure ASCII + HTML entities (apply.php aborts the whole chain on invalid
-- UTF-8 -> every host 502s). `excerpt` and `meta_description` carry REAL em-dashes
-- instead, because they are consumed as PLAIN TEXT by the LinkedIn / newsletter /
-- og:description copy, which does not decode entities.
--
-- HERO: NOT shipped here. A .sql file cannot render a PNG, so `hero_image_url` stays
-- NULL until the generator is run ON PROD after this deploy lands. pickTheme() dry-run
-- on this exact title -> theme=coding_agent (cyan terminal), matching both siblings so
-- the three UOB cards read as a series in the listing.
--
-- Idempotent: guarded on the UNIQUE `url_key`, INSERT IGNORE on the tag links, and the
-- likes top-up is guarded on `likes` = 0 so real storefront likes are never clobbered.
-- Safe to re-run; store-agnostic content, harmless on partner DBs.
--
-- apply.php splits on semicolon-at-EOL, so each statement is ONE line.

INSERT INTO `mmd_blog_post`
  (`title`, `url_key`, `excerpt`, `content`, `author`, `status`, `published_at`,
